<p>Increases your maximum energy by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 12, 17, 21, 25.</acronym> You also gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.8, 1.3, 1.7, 2.1, 2.5</acronym> Psi for each kill and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.5, 2.5, 3.4, 4.2, 5.0</acronym> Psi for each mind critical.</p>